  "details": "I have disabled Third-Person View permanently from my world's settings because it conflicts with my own.\n\nI heavily use mouse scroll wheel for inputs in my worlds as it is the closest equivalent to right thumbstick on VR controllers, but as I start to use my scroll wheel to e.g. navigate my quick menu (see attachment), a notification saying `Third-Person View is not allowed in this world` keeps getting spammed on the screen every 5 seconds.\n\nI can understand this notification being displayed once after joining the world, but repeatedly displaying it every 5 seconds is a little excessive and not only is it distracting, it can become quite irritating very quickly.",
